/T (In this project, a voltage sensor and a current sensor are used to detect the electrical parameters. Their outputs are analog signals. The ESP32 reads these signals through its analog-to-digital converter \(ADC\), processes the resulting digital values and sends information to the LCD using an I2C interface. The display provides a convenient visual output for the measured parameters. The project is educational in nature. It helps connect the)
