115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 62 0 R
/T (The project covers the sensing and display path of an electronic meter. It begins with an electrical supply and connected load. Voltage and current sensors detect the corresponding parameters and provide analog outputs. The ESP32 converts the sensor signals into digital values using its ADC and processes the readings. Finally, the information is transferred to the LCD through the I2C module.)
/E (The project covers the sensing and display path of an electronic meter. It begins with an electrical supply and connected load. Voltage and current sensors detect the corresponding parameters and provide analog outputs. The ESP32 converts the sensor signals into digital values using its ADC and processes the readings. Finally, the information is transferred to the LCD through the I2C module.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
