/Title (Electricity consumption is an important quantity to observe in homes, laboratories and industrial environments. A conventional meter generally provides a reading that must be checked at the meter itself. A smart electronic monitoring arrangement can make electrical readings easier to observe by processing sensor information and showing it on a digital display.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 492 0 R
/Next 619 0 R
>>
